  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Some items are scaled automatically based on the avatar's size.\n\nHowever, the resulting scale isn't always what you want, and items may end up looking too small or too large, which can feel off.\n\nwhile I generally support the idea of scaling, but please don't make item scaling dependent on the avatar's size.",
